title = "Valley Heart"
unlock_flag = "help_page:valley_heart"
locked_until_flag = true
body = "The Valley Heart responds to care.

Farming, friendship, helping others, and restoring the land can awaken new signs of life. As the Heart grows stronger, the valley may begin to change.

[b]Tip:[/b] Completing certain milestones will reward you with helpful perks and gifts, so make sure to tend the world often~"
